+# Portfolio project content
+
+Project descriptions reflect details supplied by the portfolio owner. Entries marked “Details coming soon” are placeholders and should be replaced with verified project information.
+
+## LEBWPOLISH
+A Polish-learning platform designed around small daily activities toward B1 proficiency. React 19 and Firebase power guided missions, spaced-repetition cloze games, writing practice, grammar, reading, role-play, and cross-device progress syncing. Includes an offline standalone game, regression tests, and Netlify deployment.
+
+Stack: React 19, Firebase, Netlify
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/lebwpolish
+
+## Healthy Watcher
+A zero-server-cost website monitoring system using Python, SQLite, and Streamlit. GitHub Actions checks sites every 30 minutes, sends Telegram outage and recovery alerts, and feeds an uptime and response-time dashboard with invite-only access and audit logs.
+
+Stack: Python, SQLite, Streamlit, GitHub Actions
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/healthy-watcher
+
+## HireMeD
+An automated job-search pipeline for the Polish IT market. It gathers Adzuna listings, extracts full descriptions with Playwright, translates Polish listings, ranks matches against a resume using cosine similarity, and sends high-scoring roles to Telegram. Results are logged to Excel and displayed in Streamlit.
+
+Stack: Python, Playwright, Streamlit, Adzuna API
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/HireMeD
+
+## Saving for Future
+A savings-oriented software project exploring tools for planning ahead and tracking financial goals. The feature set, technology stack, and current release status will be documented as the project evolves.
+
+Stack: Details coming soon
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/savingforfuture
+
+## Budgeto
+A responsive personal-finance application for recording income and expenses, setting monthly budgets, and managing savings goals. Built with React, Redux, and Material UI, with Firebase real-time synchronization across devices and deployments on GitHub Pages and Netlify.
+
+Stack: React, Redux, Material UI, Firebase
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/budgeto
+
+## OURA
+A React Native mobile project focused on Rwanda’s bus and public-transport experience. It explores a mobile-first way to make local transport easier to navigate; detailed features, integrations, and release information will be added as development progresses.
+
+Stack: React Native · Details coming soon
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/oura
+
+## Malware Scanner by Date
+A GPL v2 WordPress security plugin inspired by a real cleanup of thousands of injected files. It scans files changed within a suspected compromise window, flags suspicious PHP, JavaScript, and HTML patterns, shows live progress, maintains logs, supports quarantine, and protects WordPress core files.
+
+Stack: PHP, WordPress, Security
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/malware-scanner-by-date
+
+## RwandaLead AI
+An AI-oriented project exploring practical applications of intelligent software. Its specific workflows, supported data sources, and implementation details will be added once the repository documentation is ready.
+
+Stack: Details coming soon
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/rwandalead-ai
+
+## Rwanda Tourism Service-Gap Finder
+A Python and Playwright research tool that audits Google Maps listings in Kigali, Musanze, Gisenyi, and Butare. It identifies tourism businesses with missing websites, limited reviews, or low ratings, labels potential service gaps, and exports leads to Excel. Documentation notes scraping terms-of-service considerations.
+
+Stack: Python, Playwright, Excel
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/service_gap_finder
+
+## Stonka Hunter
+A computer-vision tool for identifying Colorado potato beetles from camera feeds or uploaded photos. It uses a custom-trained YOLOv8 model on a 12-class insect dataset, priority pest alerts, weather and location context, a detection gallery, and adjustable confidence settings.
+
+Stack: Python, YOLOv8, OpenCV, Streamlit
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/Stonka-Hunter
+
+## Rwanda Flight Price Tracker
+An automated flight-deal tracker for routes between Poland or Germany and Kigali during July–August 2026. It compares date combinations through the Duffel API, converts prices to PLN, checks every 30 minutes via GitHub Actions, and sends Telegram alerts with Google Flights links.
+
+Stack: Python, Duffel API, GitHub Actions
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/kigali_flight
+
+## LEBWPOLISH App
+The companion mobile project for LEBWPOLISH, built with Expo and React Native. Its repository structure includes Tailwind-style tooling and EAS workflows; feature-by-feature documentation will be added as the mobile experience develops.
+
+Stack: Expo, React Native, EAS
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/lebwpolish-App
+
+## PharmaFind
+A React and Tailwind CSS web project currently being documented. Its README still contains the starter template, so the app’s purpose, main features, and current status will be updated before a detailed case study is published.
+
+Stack: React, Tailwind CSS
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/PharmaFind
+
+## Ikimina Voting App
+A responsive community savings-group voting application developed at Ngana Tech. Participants sign in with unique codes, complete a limited number of tests, receive ten unique randomized number-and-name pairs, cast votes, and log out. Session state is stored locally and the app is deployed on Vercel.
+
+Stack: React, Local Storage, Vercel
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/ikimina_voting_app
+
+## LearnByWriting V3
+A language-learning application centered on consistent daily writing practice, with an improved user interface and learning experience. Built with React, Redux, Material UI, and Firebase, and deployed to GitHub Pages and Netlify; expanded feature documentation is planned.
+
+Stack: React, Redux, Material UI, Firebase
+Repository: https://github.com/Byadiso/learnByWritingV3
